text Waiting around with nothing to do just makes me hungry.
text I regret not buying some bread this morning, but it's too late for that.
text Is Kotomi in the library already?
text I wonder what kind of bread she'd like.
text I should try getting a sweet bun that I normally wouldn't buy.
