text Hey, lady. I'd like a bun.
sound BYK.aac
text @[Grandma]
text Oh my. It's still a bit too early.
text She says that teasingly, with a huge smile.
sound BYL.aac
text @[Grandma]
text You're a growing boy. Buy any that you like.
text Thanks to the head start I got by skipping class, I can buy as many of the popular chocolate bar buns and fried cutlet sandwiches as I want.
text After paying, I head to the vending machine to buy some green tea.
text With my catch of the day in a paper bag, I head to the library.
